t%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6cfd1de4459e7496a473d817ba4f422e 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私はあなたの音楽が好きです\nVTuberのShinobuと申します。\n\nTwitchやYouTubeで使えるようなBGMをつくってほしいです。\n\nこれのようなスタイルのものを作っていただけると嬉しいです。https://youtu.be/rB7XFQgJHBI\nしかし、それよりも遅いスピードで、パーカッションも少なめです。\nまた、ループさせることができればいいと思います。\n\nありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@parsimirian/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=021f5ca0e17183732e2bc4ee926c2076", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=021f5ca0e17183732e2bc4ee926c2076, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0606b82eb857907a305f17ec72caa54a 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6cfd1de4459e7496a473d817ba4f422e 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "ハイハイ～☆彡\nあなたの音楽は本当にかわいいです、私のVtuberのピオのために作ることを検討してください\n彼女はヒヨコで、バカでトラブルメーカーなんです。\n\nあなたが作ったこの曲は、とても気に入っています :: https://skeb.jp/@parsimirian/works/1\nでも、バカバカしくて、楽しくて、ちょっとバカバカしい音であれば、私は幸せです!!!\n音楽はストリーミングで使用されるので、ループしてくれたら完璧です。\n\nPIOリファレンス（アイデアの参考になれば！） :: https://toyhou.se/14054809.pio/gallery\n\nご検討ありがとうございました〜☆彡", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@parsimirian/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=021f5ca0e17183732e2bc4ee926c2076", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=021f5ca0e17183732e2bc4ee926c2076, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0606b82eb857907a305f17ec72caa54a 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6cfd1de4459e7496a473d817ba4f422e 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello SHIMU Sensei! I think your music is really nice and I would like to request something!\n\nContents of the request:\nI would like to make it cafe-themed and have it be relaxing! Something that you would hear and wouldn't mind listening to long periods of times\n\nPlease make the BGM loop!\n\nI liked what you did for \"Happy Valentine's Day\" ! \nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-499755717/happy-valentines-day\nso something like that would be appreciated\n\nPurpose of Use:\nI would like to use it for broadcasting\n\nCharacter\nCheck reference URL if you want more inspiration for my character and her design\n\nThank you very much! I look forward to hearing your final result!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/njkAnIi", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@parsimirian/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=021f5ca0e17183732e2bc4ee926c2076", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1776860743281090560%2FVvZrdNq7.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h